  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Just an idea I had but I feel like it may be seen as excluding others but I feel like it may be the only way to avoid children on VRC since most use Quest. Yes, I know people besides kids use the Quest but hear me out:\nImagine you want to play a PUBLIC game of Murder 4 but don't want to risk dealing with annoying children who use Quest.\nAdd an option to make it Public, but PC only, even if the world is both Quest and PC compatible.\nI know it sounds awful but at this point, it's the only way for us to really keep kids out of lobbies. Just give us the option to keep Quest users out of worlds if we don't want to deal with the kids.\nAlso I'm sorry if this offends any non-kid Quest users. We're all just tired of the children.",
